    **Governs:** @spec.Compile, @spec.StaticCli.
note 2026-11-09T13:57:00Z
    **Decision (agent, 2026-11-09):** entities' internal rules under `guarded` (OD52 (1), (6), (9), (10), (14)): a
    guarded doubt ends only on proof; the record queue is released once the forced repair settles; `Released` frees a
    never-re-sent unknown's queue entry; U10's later success is by landing order; no `allOrNothing`.

